{
  "title": "JAMANVAAR Admin — Restaurant Operations & Intelligence",
  "text": "QA Kiosk Only Merged Admin 1791270507575\nADMIN\nQA Kiosk Only Merged Admin 1791270507575\nCtrl+K\nNo open shift\nEOD Report\nReconciliation\nAssistant\nLogout\nOPERATIONS\nDashboard\nDIGITAL ORDERING\nQR Table Ordering\nLOCKED\nMENU & INVENTORY\nMenu & Categories\nCustomisations & Tax\nPEOPLE & CASH\nOffers & Coupons\nKIOSK\nKiosk Terminals\nKiosk Appearance & Content\nKiosk Combos & Deals\nANALYTICS & SYSTEM\nReports & Analytics\nPrinters & Devices\nReceipt & E-Bill\nSync & Devices\nRestaurant Settings\nSubscription Plans\nAudit Trail Logs\nBackup & Restore\nHelp & Support\nKiosk Appearance & Content\n\nCustomize this branch's customer kiosk. Menu images, prices, availability and modifiers are managed in Menu & Categories and Customisations & Tax. Receipt content and layout are managed in Receipt & E-Bill.\n\nRestaurant logo URL\nUpload kiosk logo (PNG, JPEG or WebP, under 2MB)\nKiosk accent color\nWelcome heading\nWelcome subtitle\nStart order button\nSupporting text\nPromotion banner text\nWelcome background image URL\nShow welcome artwork\nShow promotion banner\nIdle warning after (seconds)\nIdle reset countdown (seconds)\nCustomer screen wording by language\n\nEdit welcome, menu, cart, checkout, payment, confirmation and help labels. Empty values use the default wording. Values containing placeholders should retain those placeholders.\n\nEN\nHI\nGU\nMR\nTA\nTE\nKN\nscreen_choose_your_language_8e2d06\nSave & Publish Kiosk Settings\n\nKiosk settings published. Connected kiosks receive them automatically.\n\nJAMAN AI\nACTIVE",
